@ 7.13 - Proto-Algonquian to Miami-Illinois
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Costa, David J. (1991), “The Historical Phonology of Miami-Illinois Consonants”. International Journal of American Linguistics, 57:365 – 393
	t͡ʃ > t / in nominal suffixes
	t > t͡ʃ / in diminutives
	s > ʃ / _i (not universal)
	s > ʃ / _iV
